Date: Fri, 29 Aug 2025 11:16:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 495/534] fix:cpu frequency switching cause d2d protocol error

Changelogs:
1. add cpu aclk mux table, mux_u_cpu_aclk_2mux1_gfree.
2. add the switching process for u84_aclk and u84_busclk.
3. modify cpu-supported frequency
4. modify spll0_fout2 freq 1600MHz
5. split the opptable into eic7700-opptable.dtsi and eic7702-opptable.dtsi

Signed-off-by: ouyanghui <ouyanghui@eswincomputing.com>
